{"id":"n67091-1-8","stage":5,"title":"뒷걸음 · 后退","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67091-1-8-1","ko":"왜 위험하게 뒤로 걷고 있어?","zh":"你怎么倒着走，这样很危险啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"위험하게","meaning":"危险","explanation":"위험하다：危险；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"위험하다","audio":"/audio/b5bc2bdd91e111ed65a2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69909","senseId":"1","lemma":"위험하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뒤로","meaning":"后，后面","explanation":"뒤：后，后面；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"뒤","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67477","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걷고","meaning":"走，行走，步行","explanation":"걷다：走，行走，步行；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"걷다","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29667","senseId":"1","lemma":"걷다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"b5bc2bdd91e111ed","term":"위험하다","zh":"危险","audio":"/audio/b5bc2bdd91e111ed65a2.mp3","entryId":"69909","definition":"有可能受到损害或伤害而不安全。","pronunciation":["위험하다"]},{"id":"c65326b2de936236","term":"뒤","zh":"后，后面","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3","entryId":"67477","definition":"朝向的反方向。","pronunciation":["뒤ː"]},{"id":"82e3bb1b27351e4d","term":"걷다","zh":"走，行走，步行","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3","entryId":"29667","definition":"在地上交替着抬起并移动脚，改换位置。","pronunciation":["걷ː따"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/27e51c970195c9091f23.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67091-1-8-2","ko":"뒷걸음으로 걷는 게 건강에 좋다고 들었거든.","zh":"我听说倒着走对健康有好处。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뒷걸음으로","meaning":"后退，退步","explanation":"뒷걸음：后退，退步；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"뒷걸음","audio":"/audio/c76d796addc01a877ce1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67091","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒷걸음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걷는","meaning":"走，行走，步行","explanation":"걷다：走，行走，步行；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"걷다","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29667","senseId":"1","lemma":"걷다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건강에","meaning":"健康","explanation":"건강：健康；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"건강","audio":"/audio/b9e697a6a3627e47a5d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36670","senseId":"1","lemma":"건강","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋다고","meaning":"好，有益，有效","explanation":"좋다：好，有益，有效；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"14","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들었거든.","meaning":"听说","explanation":"듣다：听说；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"4","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c76d796addc01a87","term":"뒷걸음","zh":"后退，退步","audio":"/audio/c76d796addc01a877ce1.mp3","entryId":"67091","definition":"向后移动的脚步。","pronunciation":["뒤ː꺼름","뒫ː꺼름"]},{"id":"82e3bb1b27351e4d","term":"걷다","zh":"走，行走，步行","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3","entryId":"29667","definition":"在地上交替着抬起并移动脚，改换位置。","pronunciation":["걷ː따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"b9e697a6a3627e47","term":"건강","zh":"健康","audio":"/audio/b9e697a6a3627e47a5d1.mp3","entryId":"36670","definition":"指身体或精神没有异常、很结实的状态。","pronunciation":["건ː강"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，有益，有效","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"具有使身体或健康变得更好的性质。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听说","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"接收他人口头上的传达内容。","pronunciation":["듣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/9362de24584acf5b1345.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.51,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67091","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":176,"sequenceScore":3.9867,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我听说倒着走对健康有好处。","你怎么倒着走，这样很危险啊？","我听说学校有增加新生的计划。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你怎么倒着走，这样很危险啊？","我听说学校有增加新生的计划。","我听说倒着走对健康有好处。"],"answer":2}]}
